# boot_to_flight on a 40 MIPS machine with fix D1 switched on: the same
# inputs, every program-relative time scaled by 40/9 so the menus get the
# same emulated seconds. D1 paces VGAME's frames at GOG's 11.6 a second.
# Strong observer: d1_check.py (S settles at 9, GOG's mission clock and frame rate).
--type
SETUP.EXE+888888:N
--type
SETUP.EXE+8888888:2
--type
START.EXE+133333333:\r
--click
START.EXE+533333333:258,182
--click
START.EXE+888888888:283,172
--click
START.EXE+1777777777:280,60
--click
START.EXE+3111111111:272,134
--click
START.EXE+4000000000:271,148
--click
START.EXE+4888888888:225,191
--type
VGAME.EXE+1333333333:\aq
--type
VGAME.EXE+1777777777:y
--steps
22222222222
--time-us
700000000000000
--ips
40000000
--fix
D1
